","bytes":2456},{"id":"ev-2ffb20e72c767923a83d","repository":"usememos/memos","sourceRef":"cb42e326ba9cc266a6a9570c53e0fe04c62793f4","path":"server/api/v1/space_service.go","sha256":"c00cd6ab86eefb0b3e6a8ea03c88894ac8f5dfa64ea2c1a36b8410311cc87be1","startLine":632,"endLine":663,"text":"632 | func (s *APIV1Service) resolveSpaceMemberResource(ctx context.Context, name string, currentUser *store.User) (*store.Space, *store.User, *store.SpaceMember, *store.SpaceMember, error) {
